# Secrets — the API key lives here and nowhere else
.env

# config/config.json is committed on purpose: it holds no secrets (channel
# handle + thresholds only) and cloud sessions clone the repo fresh, so it has
# to travel with it. The API key stays in .env / the environment variables.

